{
  "id": 386022195,
  "iid": 19967,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix radiotap vendor TLV handling",
  "description": "As per [radiotap TLV](https://www.radiotap.org/fields/TLV.html), radiotap headers can define vendor specific TLVs which always have the type `vendor_namespace` (30). Specific handling for this has already been implemented at [packet-ieee80211-radiotap.c#L3743](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-ieee80211-radiotap.c?ref_type=heads#L3743) but this can never be reached due to the unnecessary check for not being in TLV mode when handling iterators with the `vendor_namespace` index. This results in vendor TLVs not displaying in the dissector output.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-05-26T04:12:25.453Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-06-09T21:15:35.341Z",
